  "reference": "Mareka 10",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 52,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "10",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "MRK 10"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "10",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wanyamukili kwenoku, hakuya mwituŋa daYudeya nimwishinadi daYodana. Mazaza awantu hiyakumupompela cheŋi, hakuyileja cheŋi neyi ochu chelilaŋayi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AFwarisi hiyakwinza kudi yena nakumwihula mazu akumweseka nawu, Chaloŋa iyala kuseŋa Iŋodindi, tahindi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yena hakuyakula nindi, Mosi wayilejeli nindidi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wena nawu, Mosi wetejeli kusoneka mukanda wakuseŋa nachu, hikumuseŋa mumbanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu hakuyila nindi, Chayilejeliyi chumichi chafumini hakuchinchika kwanyichima yenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwinza kufuma kutachi kwaleŋeluwu yuma, wayileŋeli niiyala nimumbanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi muntu ashiyi tata yindi namama yindi, akakeli Iŋodindi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "niwena ayedi akekali mujimba wumu; hiyadi cheŋi ayeduku, adi mujimba wumu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi anabombuwu kudi Nzambi, bayi ayambula kudi muntuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atumbanji hiyakumwihula cheŋi nsaŋu iyi mwitala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakuyila nindi, Muntu wukuseŋa Iŋodindi hakusumbula wacheŋi, namwili Iŋodindi chatama, neli dehi wuvumbi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mumbanda wukuleka nfumwindi hakusumbuka nawacheŋi, neli dehi wuvumbi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amuleteleli anyana anyanya kulonda ayikunki, atumbanji hiyakuyihoshola. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilaŋa Yesu chanachimoniyi hakutiya kutama nankashi, hakuyila nindi, Itejenu anyana anyanya kwinza kudami, bayi muyilekeshaku, muloŋa wanta waNzambi wawena adi chochichi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nukuyileja chalala nami, muntu wukubula kutambula wanta waNzambi neyi mwana wanyanya, hakwijila mu nihantuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakuyakata mumakasindi, hakuyikiswila nkisu, hakuyinaŋika.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cheliliyi nindi aholokeli munjila, muntu hakwinza kudi yena lufuchi; hakumufukamina nakumwihula nindi, Eyi Nkuluŋaŋa wamuwahi, nukwila ŋahi kulonda nakaswani wumi wahaya nyaka? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu hakumwila nindi, Wukuntenenadi neyi muwahi? Hosi muwahuku, chiŋa Nzambi hohu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nshimbi wajiluka dehi nawu, Kujaha muntu chinjila. Kwila wuvumbi chinjila. Kwiya chinjila. Kushimuna wunsahu wakutwamba chinjila. Kudiila mukwenu yawukombi chinjila. Lemeshaku tata yeyi namama yeyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yena hakumwila nindi, Eyi Nkuluŋaŋa, yuma yejimiyi nayihembi dehi kufumisha kuwansi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu hakumushinshika, hakumukeŋa, hakumwila nindi, Kunashali chuma chimu hohu; yaloŋa wakalandishi yuma yeyi yejima winki atuzweŋi, eyi wakaheta maheta mwiwulu; winzi wunlondaŋa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilaŋa yena hakudihomba kumesu nezu odu, hakudiyila kwindi nakuneŋa; muloŋa wadiŋi muntu waheta maheta amavulu nankashi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu hakuyitala kwi-ndo; hakuyila atumbanji twindi nindi, Akwamaheta, o chamonaŋawu kukala kwijila muwanta waNzambi! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atumbanji hiyakuhayama nankashi mazu indi. Ilaŋa Yesu hakuyila cheŋi nindi, Anyikenu, akuhwelelaŋa maheta, o chamonaŋawu kukala kwijila muwanta waNzambi! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nŋameli kuhanuka mudisu dandoŋu chaswayi, kwinza mukwamaheta kwijila muwanta waNzambi chakala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wena hiyakusweja kuhayama nankashi nawu, Indi dinu wukutwesha kwamwinewa hinyi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu hakuyitala nindi, Chuma chikukaŋanya muntu, Nzambi wukuchitwesha, muloŋa yuma yejima yinatwesheki kudi Nzambi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Petulu hakutachika kumwila nindi, Tala, etu tunashiyi yuma yejima, tunakulondi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu nindi, Nukuyileja chalala nami hikudi muntu nashiyi hela itala, hela ana kwindi, hela ahelindi, hela mama yindi, hela tata yindi, hela anyana, hela maha, kukoola ami ninsaŋu yayiwahi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wukubula kutambwilamu nkulakaji katataka makonu, nimatala, niana kwindi, niahelindi, niamama, nianyana, nimaha, kubombelaku nikuyikabisha; hanyaka yakenzaku wumi wahaya nyaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilaŋa mavulu akusambila akekala akukuminina; niakukuminina akekala akusambila.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adiŋi munjila yakukanduka kuYerusalema; Yesu hakutwamina kumbidi. Hiyakuhayama, ninowu alondelelaŋa munyima hiyakutiya woma. Hakupompesha cheŋi owu ikumi nayedi, nakutachika kuyileja yuma yakamonayi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nindi, Tiyenu, hitukukanduka kuYerusalema, Mwana kamuntu akamuhana kudi awakulumpi jawatupristu nikudi ansoneki; akamuhisha nawu afwi, akamuhana kudi ajentili; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "akamuseha, akamufwŋila mazeŋi, akamuvupola, akamujaha; chimwakahita mafuku asatu wakasaŋuka mudi afu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anyana kaZebedewu aYakoba naYowanu hiyakuswila kwakwihi nayena, hiyakumwila nawu, Eyi Nkulupaŋa, tunakeŋi wutwililuku chuma chitukukulomba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yena hakuyila nindi, Alunakeŋi niyilili chumanyi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wena hiyakumwila nawu, Twiteji twakashakami mukulema kweyi, iwu kuchikasa cheyi chachidiilu, iwu kuchikasa cheyi chachimunswa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu hakuyila nindi, Chuma chimunalombi himunachilukuku. Enu mutweshi kunwa mulupasa lunukunwami? Mukutwesha kupapatishewa nachipapatishu chakupapatishawu nachu ami? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wena hiyakumwila nawu, Tukutwesha. Yesu hakuyila nindi, Lupasa lunukunwami, mwakanwamu; nichipapatishu chakumpapatishawu nachu ami, ninenu nawa akayipapatisha nachu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kwinza kushakama kuchikasa chami chachidiilu, hela kuchikasa chachimunswa, hichuma chami mwaka nichihanuku; chambala chanawa aloŋeshelewa dehi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Owu ikumi chanachitiyuwu, hiyakutachika kutiya kutama nankashi nawaYakoba naYowanu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu hakuyitambika, hakuyila nindi, Mweluka dehi anyanta jawajentili chayiyulaŋawu, niantu awu alema chekalaŋawu nawanta hadi wena; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ilaŋa mukachi kenu bayi mwakekala chochochuku. Yowu wukukeŋa kwikala muneni mukachi kenu ekali mukwakuyikalakela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yowu wukukeŋa kwikala mukwakubadika mukachi kenu ekali nduŋu yenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa chalala chenjiliyi Mwana kamuntu, halondeli nindi akamukalakeluku; nindi akakalakeli akwawu, akahani wumi windi wakukuula nachu antu amavulu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.45"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hiyakushika kuYeriku. Chadiŋi nakufumayi kuYeriku nawatumbanji twindi niizaza deneni, mwana kaTimewu Baratimewu, mputamesu, mukwakulomba, wadiŋi washakama kunsa yanjila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chanatiyiyi nawu diyi Yesu wakuNazareta, hakutachika kubilela nindi, Eyi Yesu mwana kaDavidi, ntiyili luwi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Antu amavulu hiyakumuhoshola nawu, Mwenaku. Ilaŋa yena hakusweja nikubilela nankashi nindi, Eyi mwana kaDavidi, ntiyili luwi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu hakwimana ku-ka, nindi, Mutambi kenu. Hiyakumutambika owu mputamesu, hiyakumwila nawu, Tiyaku kuwaha, nyamukaku, hakukutambika. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yena hakunata chi kovwelu chindi, hakutakumuka, hakwinza kudi Yesu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu hakumwihula nindi, Wunakeŋi nikwilili chumanyi? Mputamesu nindi, Eyi Mwanta, nakeŋi nimoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 10:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu hakumwila nindi, Yaŋa kweyi, kukuhwelela kweyi kunakukoleshi dehi. Hohenohu amona nikumona, hakumulondela Yesu munjila.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.10.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.10.52"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
